<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
